{"id":69363,"date":"2025-10-01T06:21:22","date_gmt":"2025-10-01T05:21:22","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69363"},"modified":"2026-10-08T20:08:50","modified_gmt":"2026-10-08T19:08:50","slug":"cross-torres-vedras","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/cross-torres-vedras\/","title":{"rendered":"Cross de Torres Vedras 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Cross de Torres Vedras 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Cross de Torres Vedras 2026 \/ 44\u00ba Corta-Mato de Matos Velhos<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>8 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), no <strong>Parque Verde da V\u00e1rzea<\/strong> em <strong>Torres Vedras, Lisboa<\/strong>, com in\u00edcio agendado para as <strong>09:00<\/strong> horas. A prova, qualificada pela Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo, \u00e9 aberta tanto a atletas federados como a participantes populares.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O evento desenrola-se numa pista em sistema de circuito com dist\u00e2ncias de 650m, 1.000m e 1.500m adaptadas a cada escal\u00e3o et\u00e1rio. O piso \u00e9 constitu\u00eddo exclusivamente por zonas de <strong>terra batida e relva<\/strong>, oferecendo as condi\u00e7\u00f5es cl\u00e1ssicas e ideais para a especialidade de Cross. As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es na prova s\u00e3o totalmente <strong>gratuitas<\/strong>, e a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o atribui pr\u00e9mios coletivos \u00e0s primeiras equipas e medalh\u00f5es individuais aos tr\u00eas primeiros atletas de cada escal\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A realiza\u00e7\u00e3o do evento resulta de uma organiza\u00e7\u00e3o conjunta da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Torres Vedras<\/strong>, da <strong>Uni\u00e3o Desportiva do Oeste<\/strong> e do <strong>Grupo Desportivo, Cultural e Recreativo de Matos Velhos<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio